5,1,1,talk,May,,Let's get this sorted. I'll look into the measurements of the five frontages and the ward complaint log for this point.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I'll check the supervised mornings on the next lane and the visit to the station block's bin house.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I'll take the block ledger of refuse-point expenses and the ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Midori,,I think I'll look into the statements at the residents' meeting and the station block's meeting minutes to see how others handled this.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,I will look into the truck arrival time from the crew leader and the ward filing requirements per the installations clerk.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
