11,1,2,pass,Mizuki,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Kenji,,Does anyone else think we should check the truck times? I'm just worried about how early we'd have to be up!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Kenji, I think Servas has that covered already, so we can rely on him to let us know the timing.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Indeed, I shall find out exactly when the truck arrives so we can all plan our mornings with peace of mind.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,pass,May,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
16,1,3,pass,Mizuki,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I guess you're right, @Midori! I'll just stick to the money stuff then.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Midori,,"That sounds like a good plan, Kenji. It's important to know the costs so we can all agree comfortably.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,I agree. A clear understanding of the requirements and the timing will ensure that no one feels unfairly burdened by the new arrangement.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,May,,I'm satisfied with our list. I'll go ahead and gather my information now.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
