22,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I'm also ready. I'll go see what the neighbors in the next lane are dealing with.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
