24,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I'm on it! I'll go find out about the subsidies and the ledger right away!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
