26,1,4,talk,Midori,,I'll start my research too. I hope we can find a way to keep everyone happy.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
