64,3,,status,Midori,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
65,3,1,talk,May,,"So we have three options: Rotating Location, Managed Collection Hours, or an Enclosed Structure. Given the complaints and the space issues, I'm leaning toward Rotating Location to keep things fair.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,I'm against the Enclosed Structure because of the smell and maintenance issues. Managed Collection Hours seems too stressful given the early truck arrival and the reluctance to police neighbors. I vote for Rotating Location.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm worried about the cost of a structure, and the early hours for Managed Collection sound like a pain. Rotating Location seems like the easiest way to keep it fair! I vote Rotating Location.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,1,talk,Midori,,"I'm worried that Rotating Location might cause new friction if some frontages are too narrow, but the other options seem more likely to cause arguments. I'll vote for Rotating Location for the sake of harmony.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,1,talk,Servas,,"I have considered the burden of time and the weight of bureaucracy. A permanent structure is too demanding, and strict hours may strain our spirits. I also vote for Rotating Location.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,2,talk,May,,It looks like we are all in agreement then. Rotating the location seems to be the only way to ensure no one person is stuck with the burden forever.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"It's a relief we've reached a consensus so quickly. As long as we're mindful of the narrowest spots, it's the most logical choice.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,2,talk,Kenji,,I'm just glad we don't have to spend a ton of money on a shelter that might just smell bad anyway! Rotating sounds like a win for everyone.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,2,talk,Midori,,I'm glad we could all agree. Let's just make sure we communicate clearly about the rotation so that no one feels overwhelmed or ignored.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,2,talk,Servas,,"Indeed. When we share the burden, we strengthen the bonds of our community. Let us move forward with this rotation in a spirit of mutual kindness and understanding.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,3,talk,May,,"Since we've all voted for Rotating Location, I think we can officially call this decided. It's the fairest way to handle the space and the complaints.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. Let's just make sure we coordinate the schedule carefully so the transition between houses is smooth and doesn't cause any new stress.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I'll help make the schedule! I can use a calendar or something so we don't forget whose turn it is to have the bins.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,3,talk,Midori,,"That's very kind of you, Kenji! Your energy will make the process much easier for everyone. I'm just happy we've found a way to move forward together.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,3,talk,Servas,,"Your enthusiasm is a gift to us all, Kenji. May this new arrangement be a bridge that brings us closer as neighbors, rather than a wall that divides us.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,3,4,talk,May,,I'm glad we're all on the same page. Let's finalize this and let the ward office know we've chosen the Rotating Location.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
81,3,4,pass,May,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
82,3,4,talk,Mizuki,,I'll help with the final paperwork if needed. I'm glad we chose the most practical path.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
83,3,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
84,3,4,talk,Kenji,,I'm all set! Let's do this!,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
85,3,4,talk,Midori,,I'm just happy we could settle this so peacefully. I'll make sure to check in with everyone once the rotation starts.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
86,3,4,talk,Servas,,It has been a pleasure to find such unity among us. Let us step forward with grace and keep our hearts open to one another.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
87,3,4,pass,Servas,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
